OL,3,GNEWSACleverly to run as Tory London
OL,4,Amayor candidate
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer cabinet minister Sir James
OL,7,FCleverly has been selected as the
OL,8,FConservative candidate for mayor of
OL,9,FLondon.
OL,11,FThe MP for Braintree in Essex was
OL,12,Fchosen in a poll of party members in
OL,13,FLondon - the next mayoral election will
OL,14,Fbe in May 2028.
OL,16,FA former home secretary and foreign
OL,17,Fsecretary, Sir James saw off a
OL,18,Fchallenge from Westminster City
OL,19,Fcouncillor Festus Akinbusoye and
OL,20,FRichmond Park parliamentary candidate
OL,21,FSara Gezdari.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
