OL,3,GNEWSACleverly to run as Tory London
OL,4,Amayor candidate
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir James, a former head of the London
OL,7,FFire Authority, was widely expected to
OL,8,Fwin the nomination after he stood down
OL,9,Ffrom the shadow cabinet in August.
